  <prompt>Replace /conflict-check's own file-overlap step with a call to scripts/quality/coordination-detector.py, keeping its hot-path watchlist.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE AI-procedure maintainer.</role>
  <goal>One implementation of file-overlap detection exists; /conflict-check calls it.</goal>

